          "text": "Neck pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "5–6 days of constant dull ache in the right posterior neck/upper shoulder, rated 4–5/10, with a sharp twinge when turning the head to the right or reversing the car. Worse at the end of the day and better in the morning and after a hot shower. Onset was insidious after a long day at the computer; possibly related to a new chair or sleeping awkwardly."
      }
